.nh
.TH "GUMROAD" "1" "Sep 2026" "Gumroad" "Gumroad CLI"

.SH NAME
gumroad-admin-products-files-download - Download a product file for content review


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgumroad admin products files download   [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Download a product file's actual contents through the admin API, so content review does not need a real purchase.

.PP
Get file ids with \fBgumroad admin products view <product-id> --json --jq '.product.files[] | [.id, .display_name]'\fR\&. The result includes soft-deleted files, which can still be downloaded because reviews often concern a removed prior version.

.PP
External links have no stored bytes, so the command prints the link without fetching its host.

.PP
JSON output reports the path and file metadata without exposing the temporary signed URL.

.PP
Every download is audit-logged and requires per-actor admin auth.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--force\fP[=false]
	Overwrite the output file if it already exists

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for download

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP=""
	Write the file to this path (- for stdout; defaults to a private gumroad-review path)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	Enable debug logging to stderr

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	Preview mutating requests without executing them

.PP
\fB--jq\fP=""
	Filter JSON output with a jq expression

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Output as JSON

.PP
\fB--no-color\fP[=false]
	Disable color output

.PP
\fB--no-image\fP[=false]
	Disable image rendering

.PP
\fB--no-input\fP[=false]
	Disable interactive prompts

.PP
\fB--non-interactive\fP[=false]
	Run in explicit CI/agent mode

.PP
\fB--page-delay\fP=0s
	Wait between paginated --all requests (e.g. 200ms, 1s)

.PP
\fB--plain\fP[=false]
	Output as plain tab-separated text

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	Suppress non-essential output

.PP
\fB--yes\fP[=false]
	Skip confirmation prompts


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  gumroad admin products files download <product-id> <file-id>
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgumroad-admin-products-files(1)\fP
